sequenceDiagram
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant PL as Poller
    participant KF as Kafka (16 parts)
    participant SP as Spark Streaming
    participant CK as ClickHouse
    participant PQ as Parquet
    participant AP as FastAPI
    participant FE as Next.js

    loop Mỗi 60 giây
        PL->>GH: GET /events (ETag)
        GH-->>PL: 200 OK / 304 Not Modified
        PL->>KF: publish batch events
    end

    loop Mỗi 60 giây (micro-batch)
        SP->>KF: consume offset
        SP->>SP: parse + watermark + dedup
        SP->>CK: INSERT chunk 1000 rows
        SP->>PQ: write Parquet partition
    end

    FE->>AP: GET /dashboard/trending
    AP->>CK: SELECT ... GROUP BY ...
    CK-->>AP: result < 200ms
    AP-->>FE: JSON response
